# Proof: F-V2-ENGINE
# Top: protocol_engine_v2
# Assumptions: Initial sampled reset; arbitrary inputs and fetched instructions.
# Properties: FIFO bounds/order, stack bound, ownership, and open-drain safety.
# Method: temporal induction; bounded success alone is insufficient.
# Scope and abstractions: formal/README.md.

read_verilog -formal src/v2_engine.v
prep -top protocol_engine_v2
flatten
memory_map
opt
async2sync
dffunmap
sat -seq 4 -tempinduct -maxsteps 16 -set-assumes -prove-asserts -verify
